Vá pra cama, Jacob.

653
00:40:21,684 --> 00:40:22,784
Sra. Parker?

654
00:40:22,785 --> 00:40:25,019
Confisquei o "walkie" do Howie.

655
00:40:25,021 --> 00:40:26,188
Deveria estar fazendo
o dever de casa

656
00:40:26,189 --> 00:40:28,056
